Green Vibe integrates Numérique Responsable (Sustainable IT) practices -
Green IT, IT for Green, IT for Social and Social for IT - into the Mistral
Vibe coding agent.

Rule content is authored by the Institut du Numérique Responsable.

Rule sheets record their provenance ("origin" field: INR, and the official
referentials they relate to, such as RGESN, RGAA or WCAG) and the RGESN
criterion when one applies ("rgesn" field). Identifiers
NR-* are Green Vibe project identifiers, not official criterion numbers.
